# monitoring logs (interesting topics)
journalctl -- how to make persistant

rsyslog -- configure remote logging:
- on receiver, in /etc/rsyslog.conf:
  $ModLoad imtcp
  $InputTCPServerRun 514
  $template DynamicFile,"/var/log/loghost/%HOSTNAME%/%syslogfacility-text%.log"
  *.* -?DynamicFile

- restart rsyslog, add entry to /etc/logrotate.d/syslog:
/var/log/loghost/*/*.log
- allow the port in firewall
- on sender in /etc/rsyslog.conf:
  *.* @@servera.lab.example.com:514

